	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"5231918c238a3af5",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":" ∴ النباش سارق \n- natijah qiyas sabiq\n- muqaddimah shugra qiyas lahiq",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-60,
			"y":-132,
			"width":240,
			"height":204
		},
		{
			"id":"598fcb09f0b582e3",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":" وكل سارق تقطع يده\n ∴ فالنباش تقطع يده",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-60,
			"y":92,
			"width":240,
			"height":67
		},
		{
			"id":"9bd6c41e0eaae9cd",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":" النباش آخذ للمال خفية\n وكل آخذ للمال خفية سارق\n\n",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-360,
			"y":-220,
			"width":240,
			"height":68
		},
		{
			"id":"2f51d9e298c7861a",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"---\n\n---\n— \nnatijah dibuang",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-360,
			"y":-132,
			"width":240,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1edeeed75dd6a22f",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"متصل النتيجة",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-60,
			"y":-300,
			"width":240,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"87b3c5e5f4707f1b",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"مفصول النتيجة",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-360,
			"y":-300,
			"width":240,
			"height":60,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{
			"id":"e89cefc4ae353dae",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":" وكل سارق تقطع يده\n ∴ فالنباش تقطع يده",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-360,
			"y":-52,
			"width":240,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"9386b094c0c8d78a",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"qiyas khuluf → prosedur qiyas yang menetapkan validitas kesimpulan dengan menetapkan absurdnya (batalnya) kebalikan dari kesimpulan tersebut",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-580,
			"y":220,
			"width":380,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"00baf1da976f2ce4",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"∴ لو لم يكن الله تعالى قديما لم يوجد العالم ",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-580,
			"y":540,
			"width":340,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a8c4c3f172372768",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"لو لم يكن الله تعالى قديما لكان حادثا\nولو كان حادثا لم يوجد العالم\n\n",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-580,
			"y":440,
			"width":340,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"286da08d46b2a05a",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"**qiyas I** iqtirani syarthi ",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-130,
			"y":470,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1a64160c71652d11",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"لكن العالم موجود\n∴ فإن الله قديم\n",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-580,
			"y":620,
			"width":340,
			"height":70
		},
		{
			"id":"b86b3383dd2e88bf",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"**qiyas II** istitsna'i ittisholi dengan mengecualikan naqidh tali",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-130,
			"y":570,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"26d35a3074060aa9",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"\n| perbandingan            | mantiq      | ushul fikih |\n| ----------------------- | ----------- | ----------- |\n| qiyas                   | tamtsil     | qiyas       |\n| musyabbah **anggur**    | hadd ashgar | furu'       |\n| musyabbah bih **khamr** | ushul       | ushul       |\n| jami' **memabukkan**    | hadd awsath | illat       |\n| hukum **haram**         | hadd akbar  | hukum       |\n",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-120,
			"y":200,
			"width":440,
			"height":220
		},
